{"lyrics":"[Intro: Juice WRLD & Yuna]\n[00:07.60]Yeah\n[00:07.78]I want us forever\n[00:09.88]I want you forever\n[00:12.94]I want this forever\n[00:13.66](DRMZ, you a fool for this one)\n[00:14.40]I love you, listen\n[00:14.84](\n[00:14.92]Forever in my mind, only you\n[00:15.78])\n[00:15.82](\n[00:15.92]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[00:16.88]) I really care for you\n[00:17.74](\n[00:17.80]Forever in my mind, only you\n[00:18.48]) I really do\n[00:18.90](\n[00:19.06]The pieces in my life\n[00:19.54]) Listen (\n[00:19.94]Go away with you\n[00:20.42])\n[00:20.44](\n[00:20.52]Forever in my mind, only you\n[00:21.46])\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:21.56]Forever, forever\n[00:21.98]She stay on my mind like forever, forever (Forever, forever)\n[00:24.96]For worse or for better\n[00:27.40]I'm willing to fight for her heart, it's a pleasure (I really am)\n[00:32.52]Hope she get the message\n[00:34.04]I swear she an angel, that's word back to Heaven (That's word to God)\n[00:37.74]Man, fuck all the stressing and fighting\n[00:38.82]I want you forever, forever (I want you forever)\n[00:41.20]I'm writing these verses\n[00:42.26]Rehearse it, record it and play it at your request (And play it at your request)\n[00:44.82]I feel like it's us two forever\n[00:45.62]But I think that we just don't know it yet (Don't think that we know it yet)\n[00:48.02]I swear life is a bitch\n[00:48.58]I'ma toss it a bone, 'cause I feel like it's playing fetch (I feel like it's playing fetch)\n[00:51.72]You keepin' my heart or you tossin' it?\n[00:53.06]Baby, I know I hate playing catch (You know I hate playing catch)\n[00:54.64]Forever, forever\n[00:55.00]Say that no matter no weather (Right)\n[00:56.56]Heart getting colder than winter\n[00:57.62]But I say, \"No matter the weather,\" and don't you forget it (Right)\n[01:00.18]I look at love and then have all these questions (Right)\n[01:03.58]I look at you and then get all these answers (Right)\n[01:04.96]Fuck all these hoes, can you please mind my manners? (Right)\n[01:06.76]Monkey around, 'cause you drive me bananas (Right)\n[01:09.00]You put the nails to my hammer\n[01:10.00]Without you, I'm deadly like cancer, think of your answer\n[01:12.30]I feel like it's us and the planet and baby, I'm not being antsy\n[01:14.56]I'm just hoping you understand me\n[01:16.34]Look what you do to me, this is so crazy, yeah\n[01:17.68]I'm happy to call you my lady, yeah\n[01:18.78]I'm happy to say we together\n[01:19.50]And I hope this shit last forever, forever, yeah\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD & Yuna]\n[01:20.90](\n[01:20.98]Forever in my mind, only you\n[01:21.76]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[01:22.66]) Yeah\n[01:22.80](\n[01:22.86]Forever in my mind, o-o-only you\n[01:23.88])\n[01:24.00]I love you\n[01:24.20](\n[01:24.28]The pieces in my life go-go-go away with you\n[01:25.76])\n[01:25.86]I hope you feelin' this as much as I am\n[01:27.94](\n[01:28.54]Forever in my mind, only you\n[01:30.88])\n[01:31.00]Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[01:31.80](\n[01:31.92]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[01:34.32])\n[01:34.38]Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[01:35.04](\n[01:35.12]Forever in my mind, only you\n[01:36.86])\n[01:36.92]It's really crazy how I feel about you\n[01:40.08](\n[01:40.14]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[01:41.24])\n[01:41.34]This one finna get personal though, check (\n[01:43.38]Mind\n[01:43.46])\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[01:43.54]I'm losin' my mind\n[01:44.28]I'm losin' my mind, you drivin' me crazy (\n[01:46.26]Mind\n[01:46.34]; I'm goin' insane)\n[01:47.14]The shit we got into\n[01:47.72]The shit that we been through, shit, life is amazing (I swear, life is amazing) I'm not going nowhere\n[01:52.00]You not going nowhere, so baby, just face it\n[01:53.16]You're perfectly perfect for me\n[01:55.66]Baby, I'm able to actually give you this label, my queen\n[01:59.50]Girl, you deserve it\n[02:01.62]We been through our bullshit but, girl, it was worth it\n[02:06.00]I found Mrs. Right, I can't do no more searchin'\n[02:10.90]Fuck all the clownin' shit, this not a circus\n[02:12.52]I love for a reason, I love for a purpose\n[02:13.76]Wasn't an accident, this is on purpose\n[02:14.84]Put that on God, I can't do no more merchin' (No)\n[02:15.82]Don't turn your back, I can't take no more hurtin' (No)\n[02:17.20]Baby, I swear your love get me the highest\n[02:20.22]I look down below and I think that I'm flying (Yeah)\n[02:25.96]But really I'm falling, falling in love with you (Yeah)\n[02:29.90]Girl, it's because of you, girl, you the finest (Yeah)\n[02:36.00]Searching for love and you just helped me find it (Yeah)\n[02:37.70]Let's leave the bullshit and garbage behind us (Yeah)\n[02:38.86]Fuck the mistakes, let's not let them remind us\n[02:40.32]'Cause we at the top and let's do some more climbing\n[02:41.52]Girl, at this point, I'm pretty sure now you know just what you do to me\n[02:44.20]This shit that's new to me, girl\n[02:47.66]Finding my way through this jungle of life and it's foolery\n[02:50.80]So just get used to me, girl\n[02:52.06]I'm new to relationships, usually girls be abusing me\n[02:54.62]They just be using me, girl\n[02:56.74]This got me thinking forever, no matter no weather\n[03:00.20]That it's gon' be you and me, girl (Yeah)\n[Outro: Juice WRLD & Yuna]\n[03:01.04](\n[03:01.14]Forever in my mind, only you\n[03:01.72])\n[03:01.78]Yeah\n[03:01.86](\n[03:01.92]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[03:02.70])\n[03:02.78]Yeah\n[03:02.86](\n[03:02.92]Forever in my mind, only you\n[03:03.46])\n[03:03.52]Yeah, yeah\n[03:03.78](\n[03:03.84]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[03:05.30])\n[03:05.38]And that's how I feel, for real\n[03:06.40](\n[03:06.48]Forever in my mind, only you\n[03:07.16]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[03:08.16])\n[03:08.24]I love you\n[03:08.46](\n[03:08.52]Forever in my mind, only you\n[03:09.16]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[03:09.94])\n[03:10.00]I love you\n[03:10.22](\n[03:10.28]Forever in my mind\n[03: